, è un ragazzo nato a Castelluzzo del Golfo, una splendida località di mare in Sicilia. Durante l'estate conosce Sally, una ragazza americana con cui avrà una breve storia. Al termine dell'estate, Sally torna a casa. Tanino parte qualche giorno dopo per gli Stati Uniti, di notte e senza avvisare nessuno, per raggiungere Sally ma anche per evitare il servizio di leva."},{"language":"en-US","title":"My Name Is Tanino","overview":"During a sun-soaked Sicilian summer, aimless filmmaking undergrad and back-seat radical Tanino has a fling with Sally, a dreamy American tourist from an upper background. When summer ends, Sally flies back home, without ever reaching out. Clueless, a smitten Tanino decides to pay her a surprise visit under the pretense of returning a camera she left behind. But when he gets there, he quickly realizes the reality of America—and his relationship with Sally's—is far from the idealized version his small-town boy imagination conjured."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cng6uZTl3976xPWgXWxMt31H8d0.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jNCuGYz44X59e5fZpLjD8i1QOg2.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":56378,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cng6uZTl3976xPWgXWxMt31H8d0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cng6uZTl3976xPWgXWxMt31H8d0.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cng6uZTl3976xPWgXWxMt31H8d0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cng6uZTl3976xPWgXWxMt31H8d0.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1HTc3XhsW5SPoQExwiGf3vYbBUz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1HTc3XhsW5SPoQExwiGf3vYbBUz.jpg","